sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant API as FastAPI route
    participant Facade as PeerRoomsApp
    participant S as RoomService
    participant Repo as RoomRepository
    participant Room
    participant State as RoomState
    participant Bus as EventBus
    participant Inbox as NotificationService
    Student->>API: POST /api/rooms/{room_id}/join
    API->>Facade: join_room(student_id, room_id)
    Facade->>S: join_room(student_id, room_id)
    Note over S: Validate student
    S->>S: Acquire room lock
    S->>Repo: get(room_id)
    Repo-->>S: Room snapshot
    S->>Room: join(student_id, now)
    Note over Room: Reject an existing seat or place in queue
    Room->>State: join(room, student_id, now)
    alt OpenState
        State->>Room: Seat student and mark FULL if needed
    else FullState
        State->>Room: Add to FIFO queue
    else ClosedState
        State-->>Room: Raise RoomClosedError
    end
    State-->>S: JoinOutcome on success
    S->>Repo: save(room)
    S->>S: Release lock
    S->>Bus: StudentJoined or StudentWaitlisted
    Bus->>Inbox: Notify the host at the time of the join
    S-->>Facade: JoinOutcome
    Facade-->>API: JoinView
    API-->>Student: JOINED or WAITLISTED with position
